    "Because we do not collect data, we do not anticipate needing to update this policy often. Fundamental changes will be reflected in our open source repositories and in-app documentation.": {
      "comment": "Description of a privacy policy section that states that fundamental changes to the policy will be reflected in the open source repositories and in-app documentation.",
